    "name": "Apache NiFi REST Access Connections API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "A best-effort OpenAPI 3.1 description of selected endpoints from the Apache\nNiFi REST API. NiFi exposes a comprehensive JWT-authenticated REST API for\nmanaging processors, connections, controller services, process groups,\nreporting tasks, provenance, flow versions, system diagnostics, access\ncontrol, parameter contexts, and data transfer. The canonical machine\nreadable specification is published by the NiFi project as\n`/nifi-docs/swagger.yaml`.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache NiFi",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
